{
  "method": "recognizer_word_times",
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "start": 0.68,
      "end": 1.38,
      "text": "In Midland,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "start": 1.42,
      "end": 3.36,
      "text": "a column of drill pipe over",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "start": 3.4,
      "end": 6.09,
      "text": "two stories tall swings toward the hole.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "start": 6.13,
      "end": 8.73,
      "text": "The floorhand pulls back both gloves,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5",
      "start": 8.77,
      "end": 11.62,
      "text": "because a robot arm already has it.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c6",
      "start": 11.82,
      "end": 13.78,
      "text": "On this ExxonMobil rig,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7",
      "start": 13.84,
      "end": 15.99,
      "text": "robotic arms set the pipe in place",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c8",
      "start": 16.03,
      "end": 17.96,
      "text": "and connect it to the drill string.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c9",
      "start": 18.17,
      "end": 19.54,
      "text": "Crews on the floor used",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c10",
      "start": 19.58,
      "end": 21.34,
      "text": "to help do that by hand.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c11",
      "start": 21.38,
      "end": 23.21,
      "text": "So the floor gets a fence.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c12",
      "start": 23.25,
      "end": 26.25,
      "text": "The gate carries a sign that reads Red Zone,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c13",
      "start": 26.29,
      "end": 28.2,
      "text": "with a drawing of the Grim Reaper.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c14",
      "start": 29.02,
      "end": 31.28,
      "text": "Exxon's Bart Cahir says about a third",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c15",
      "start": 31.32,
      "end": 33.04,
      "text": "of significant drilling injuries",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c16",
      "start": 33.08,
      "end": 34.46,
      "text": "have happened right here,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c17",
      "start": 34.5,
      "end": 35.68,
      "text": "on the rig floor.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c18",
      "start": 36.13,
      "end": 37.89,
      "text": "Drilling contractor Helmerich and",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c19",
      "start": 37.93,
      "end": 39.76,
      "text": "Payne supplies the system.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c20",
      "start": 39.92,
      "end": 41.64,
      "text": "Three arms move pipe",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c21",
      "start": 41.68,
      "end": 43.78,
      "text": "weighing roughly 2,000 pounds.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c22",
      "start": 44.1,
      "end": 46.56,
      "text": "One walks each stand to the hole,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c23",
      "start": 46.6,
      "end": 48.36,
      "text": "one lines up the threads,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c24",
      "start": 48.4,
      "end": 51.11,
      "text": "and one racks pipe high in the derrick.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c25",
      "start": 51.52,
      "end": 53.1,
      "text": "So where did the crew go?",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c26",
      "start": 53.14,
      "end": 55.55,
      "text": "Up into a small office on the rig,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c27",
      "start": 55.59,
      "end": 57.37,
      "text": "where a contractor runs the",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c28",
      "start": 57.41,
      "end": 59.56,
      "text": "robots with controls on a screen.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c29",
      "start": 59.84,
      "end": 61.665,
      "text": "That contractor is the driller,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c30",
      "start": 61.705,
      "end": 64.05,
      "text": "who starts each move and watches it,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c31",
      "start": 64.09,
      "end": 67.06,
      "text": "and the arms follow paths planned in advance.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c32",
      "start": 67.26,
      "end": 69.56,
      "text": "The crew works out the exact moves",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c33",
      "start": 69.6,
      "end": 72.16,
      "text": "with an Exxon operations team in Houston.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c34",
      "start": 72.96,
      "end": 75.58,
      "text": "Exxon runs more than 30 rigs in the Permian,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c35",
      "start": 75.62,
      "end": 76.57,
      "text": "and in August,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c36",
      "start": 76.61,
      "end": 78.92,
      "text": "Reuters counted two that were automated.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c37",
      "start": 79.22,
      "end": 81.4,
      "text": "Exxon plans to automate more than half",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c38",
      "start": 81.44,
      "end": 84.39,
      "text": "its unconventional fleet by the end of 2028.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c39",
      "start": 84.84,
      "end": 87.05,
      "text": "The first one already set a pace.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c40",
      "start": 87.09,
      "end": 90.1,
      "text": "It drilled two miles sideways underground",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c41",
      "start": 90.14,
      "end": 91.94,
      "text": "in a little over six days,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c42",
      "start": 91.98,
      "end": 95.0,
      "text": "the third fastest time in Exxon's history.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c43",
      "start": 95.34,
      "end": 97.3,
      "text": "Does a robot take a job?",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c44",
      "start": 97.54,
      "end": 99.53,
      "text": "Exxon expects similar staffing,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c45",
      "start": 99.57,
      "end": 101.57,
      "text": "and calls it a force multiplier,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c46",
      "start": 101.61,
      "end": 102.68,
      "text": "not a replacement.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c47",
      "start": 102.76,
      "end": 104.62,
      "text": "It also believes it could prevent",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c48",
      "start": 104.66,
      "end": 107.3,
      "text": "roughly a third of high-consequence incidents.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c49",
      "start": 107.48,
      "end": 110.84,
      "text": "Both are company expectations, not counts.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c50",
      "start": 111.36,
      "end": 113.26,
      "text": "Cahir says people off the floor",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c51",
      "start": 113.3,
      "end": 115.62,
      "text": "can plan the next operation instead.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c52",
      "start": 115.86,
      "end": 117.75,
      "text": "So who tightens the pipe now?",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c53",
      "start": 117.79,
      "end": 119.29,
      "text": "A robot arm does.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c54",
      "start": 119.33,
      "end": 121.2,
      "text": "A person still decides when.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    }
  ]
}
